451
00:33:31.409 --> 00:33:32.497
What's real here.

452
00:33:32.777 --> 00:33:35.273
All four labs are JDK 21.

453
00:33:35.553 --> 00:33:51.788
L2 and L4 run against a real PostgreSQL 16 (L2 also runs a real JDK HttpServer and HttpClient over TCP); L1 and L3 are deterministic simulations with a fixed seed.

454
00:33:52.068 --> 00:33:55.887
Timings in L2 and L4 vary by machine; the shapes don't.

455
00:33:56.167 --> 00:34:03.015
The Zipf popularity, click-through rate, Redis capacity and decay constant in L3 are stated assumptions.

456
00:34:04.365 --> 00:34:22.562
L2 and L4 need PostgreSQL 16 on port 5581 with a database shop and the JDBC driver jar (postgresql-42.7.4.jar) in the lab folder; the lab README has a one-command Docker alternative.

457
00:34:22.842 --> 00:34:32.122
Run every lab with -Dstdout.encoding=UTF-8; JDBC labs also need -Duser.timezone=UTC.

