00:35:18.022 --> 00:35:19.750
FOUR WAYS TO MINT A SHORT CODE.

468
00:35:20.030 --> 00:35:28.286
The grocery platform sends ~2 million SMS a day with a link (order tracking, slot reminders. your refund is processed).

469
00:35:28.566 --> 00:35:34.241
Each link needs a short, unique code: gro.cr or aZ3kP9q.

470
00:35:34.521 --> 00:35:36.483
We mint 2,000,000 codes four ways.

471
00:35:39.333 --> 00:35:40.251
On screen:

472
00:35:40.531 --> 00:35:42.365
Minting 2,000,000 short codes.

473
00:35:42.645 --> 00:36:02.848
62^6 = 56,800,235,584 62^7 = 3,521,614,606,208. strategy length collisions extra lookups neighbour guess hits.

474
00:36:03.128 --> 00:36:11.021
A) MD5(url) truncated to 6 base62 chars 6 40 0 ~0% (random).

475
00:36:11.301 --> 00:36:17.637
B) random 7 chars, check-and-retry 7 0 2,000,000 ~0% (random).

476
00:36:17.917 --> 00:36:23.165
C) counter, then base62 5 0 0 100.0%.

477
00:36:23.445 --> 00:36:31.040
D) counter, then Feistel permutation, then base62 7 0 0 0.00%.

478
00:36:31.320 --> 00:36:35.651
First five codes minted by C and D (consecutive counter values):

479
00:36:35.931 --> 00:36:36.635
C:

480
00:36:36.915 --> 00:36:41.651
6laZE 6laZF 6laZG 6laZH 6laZI.

481
00:36:41.931 --> 00:36:51.147
D: jFF7XOx jstj0mT pt1IVd8 d5RctH9 JNOJwOr.

482
00:36:51.427 --> 00:36:57.997
Birthday estimate for A: n² or 2N = 35 expected colliding pairs (measured 40).

483
00:36:58.277 --> 00:36:59.792
The rest is in the chapter.

484
00:37:02.642 --> 00:37:03.495
Reading it:

485
00:37:03.775 --> 00:37:12.607
A) Hash truncation produced 40 collisions in 2M codes, right where the birthday estimate n² or 2N = 35 says it should.

486
00:37:12.887 --> 00:37:18.946
At a year's volume the collisions number in the tens of thousands, so hashing still needs a check-and-retry.

487
00:37:19.226 --> 00:37:31.173
B) Random codes needed 0 retries, because the 7-character space is only 0.00006% full, but it still paid 2,000,000 uniqueness lookups.

488
00:37:31.453 --> 00:37:38.706
C) Counter codes are 5 characters and need nothing, but 100% of sampled neighbours were other live links:

489
00:37:38.986 --> 00:37:41.823
6laZE 6laZF 6laZG....

490
00:37:43.173 --> 00:37:45.115
D) Counter + permutation:

491
00:37:45.395 --> 00:37:56.061
0 collisions, 0 lookups, 0.00% neighbour hits: jFF7XOx jstj0mT pt1IVd8....

492
00:37:56.341 --> 00:37:58.347
The cost is two extra characters.

