00:39:52.139 --> 00:40:11.233
POST https://track.grocery.in or orders or ORD-88213?t=f3a9, then 200. code:jFF7XOx,short:https://gro.cr or jFF7XOx,existing:true.

511
00:40:11.513 --> 00:40:26.211
POST https://offers.grocery.in or diwali?utmsource=sms, then 201. code:pt1IVd8,short:https://gro.cr or pt1IVd8.

512
00:40:26.491 --> 00:40:37.414
