517
00:40:59.731 --> 00:41:06.109
The unique (owner, urlhash) constraint makes a concurrent double-create impossible, not just unlikely.

518
00:41:06.389 --> 00:41:18.677
Validation refused http://, the user-info trick (grocery.in@evil.example really points at evil.example) and the look-alike host, all before anything was stored.

519
00:41:20.027 --> 00:41:27.174
410 for the expired reminder, 404 for an unknown code and for a path that isn't a code at all.

