00:41:27.454 --> 00:41:33.833
The 302 carries Cache-Control: private, max-age=0 so browsers don't cache it.

521
00:41:34.113 --> 00:41:37.590
Under load the cache absorbed 85% of redirects.

522
00:41:37.870 --> 00:41:51.993
Only 6,806 distinct links were requested, though, so 716 database reads were duplicates: concurrent requests missed the same cold, popular code before the first one had loaded it.

